# Auto publish

After editing the graha chart, keep `graha-chart.html` as the source of truth and sync it to `index.html`.

Do not manually run git commit, git push, or Harvis deploy unless the user asks. A `stop` hook runs `.cursor/hooks/post-agent.ps1` when an agent turn completes; it:

1. Commits and pushes `graha-chart.html` and `index.html` when either changed
2. Syncs `graha-chart.html` → `index.html` → `deploy/index.html`
3. Deploys to https://velliastro.harvis.page via `npx harvis` in `deploy/`

Hook logs: `.cursor/hooks/post-agent.log`
